makes or breaks small service businesses:

572
00:19:29,800 --> 00:19:30,191
price.

573
00:19:30,542 --> 00:19:33,084
Start with what competitors charge.

574
00:19:33,264 --> 00:19:36,173
Call three local businesses offering the same

575
00:19:36,173 --> 00:19:37,983
service and ask for a quote,

576
00:19:37,983 --> 00:19:40,439
or look at their websites and reviews.

577
00:19:40,619 --> 00:19:42,012
That gives you a range.

578
00:19:42,192 --> 00:19:43,026
As a beginner,

579
00:19:43,026 --> 00:19:45,468
you might start slightly below the middle

580
00:19:45,468 --> 00:19:46,302
of that range,

581
00:19:46,302 --> 00:19:48,148
but almost never at the bottom.

582
00:19:48,328 --> 00:19:51,010
The cheapest price attracts the customers who

583
00:19:51,010 --> 00:19:52,798
complain most and pay slowest.

584
00:19:53,148 --> 00:19:54,309
Then do your own math.

585
00:19:54,489 --> 00:19:56,937
Add up your real costs per job:

586
00:19:56,937 --> 00:20:00,885
supplies, fuel, insurance spread across your jobs,

587
00:20:00,885 --> 00:20:04,043
equipment wear, payment processing fees,

588
00:20:04,043 --> 00:20:04,833
and taxes.

589
00:20:05,013 --> 00:20:07,040
Then decide what you want to earn

590
00:20:07,040 --> 00:20:08,391
per hour of your time,

591
00:20:08,391 --> 00:20:10,110
including driving and admin.

592
00:20:10,290 --> 00:20:12,560
If the market price doesn't cover that,

593
00:20:12,560 --> 00:20:14,946
either the business doesn't work for you,

594
00:20:14,946 --> 00:20:17,100
or you need to work more efficiently,

595
00:20:17,100 --> 00:20:18,963
for example with tighter routes.

596
00:20:19,313 --> 00:20:21,320
Next, think in packages,

597
00:20:21,320 --> 00:20:22,157
not hours.

598
00:20:22,337 --> 00:20:25,250
Customers understand a clear price for a

599
00:20:25,250 --> 00:20:27,653
clear result: a full house clean,

600
00:20:27,653 --> 00:20:29,765
a driveway and sidewalk wash,

601
00:20:29,765 --> 00:20:31,950
a monthly bookkeeping package.

602
00:20:32,130 --> 00:20:34,998
Packages also reward you for getting faster.

603
00:20:35,178 --> 00:20:36,581
If you charge by the hour,

604
00:20:36,581 --> 00:20:38,631
getting better at your job lowers your

605
00:20:38,631 --> 00:20:39,009
income.

606
00:20:39,189 --> 00:20:40,931
If you charge by the result,

607
00:20:40,931 --> 00:20:42,486
getting better raises it.

608
00:20:42,837 --> 00:20:45,193
And finally, raise prices regularly.

609
00:20:45,373 --> 00:20:48,238
Many owners raise prices for new customers

610
00:20:48,238 --> 00:20:51,034
first, then for existing customers once a

611
00:20:51,034 --> 00:20:52,943
year, with plenty of notice.

612
00:20:53,123 --> 00:20:55,241
If nobody ever pushes back on your

613
00:20:55,241 --> 00:20:57,047
price, it's probably too low.

614
00:20:57,227 --> 00:20:59,907
A few lost price sensitive customers are

615
00:20:59,907 --> 00:21:02,520
often replaced by better ones who value

616
00:21:02,520 --> 00:21:03,056
quality.

617
00:21:03,406 --> 00:21:05,469
You don't need an advertising budget to

618
00:21:05,469 --> 00:21:07,109
get your first fifty customers.

619
00:21:07,289 --> 00:21:09,632
Here are eight free or nearly free

620
00:21:09,632 --> 00:21:12,595
ways local service businesses find clients.

621
00:21:12,945 --> 00:21:13,154
One.

622
00:21:13,334 --> 00:21:14,762
Tell everyone you know.

623
00:21:14,942 --> 00:21:17,283
Friends, family, coworkers,

624
00:21:17,283 --> 00:21:19,191
your gym, your church.

625
00:21:19,371 --> 00:21:21,743
Most first customers come from people who

626
00:21:21,743 --> 00:21:22,784
already trust you.

627
00:21:22,964 --> 00:21:23,220
Two.

628
00:21:23,400 --> 00:21:25,060
Free business listings.

629
00:21:25,240 --> 00:21:27,415
Set up a free business profile on

630
00:21:27,415 --> 00:21:29,985
major map and search services so people

631
00:21:29,985 --> 00:21:31,962
searching nearby can find you.

632
00:21:32,142 --> 00:21:32,595
Three.

633
00:21:32,775 --> 00:21:34,708
Local community groups online,

634
00:21:34,708 --> 00:21:37,930
where neighbors ask for recommendations every day.

635
00:21:38,280 --> 00:21:38,686
Four.

636
00:21:38,866 --> 00:21:40,458
Before and after photos,

637
00:21:40,458 --> 00:21:42,779
posted everywhere, with permission.

638
00:21:42,959 --> 00:21:44,843
They show your work better than any

639
00:21:44,843 --> 00:21:45,490
description.

640
00:21:45,670 --> 00:21:46,134
Five.

641
00:21:46,314 --> 00:21:48,474
Door hangers or flyers in the exact

642
00:21:48,474 --> 00:21:50,819
neighborhood where you just did a job.

643
00:21:50,999 --> 00:21:52,316
Neighbors see your work,

644
00:21:52,316 --> 00:21:53,359
and they're nearby,

645
00:21:53,359 --> 00:21:54,841
so your routes get tighter.

646
00:21:55,021 --> 00:21:55,590
Six.

647
00:21:55,770 --> 00:21:56,688
Partnerships.

648
00:21:56,868 --> 00:21:58,077
Real estate agents,

649
00:21:58,077 --> 00:22:01,704
property managers, contractors and other small businesses

650
00:22:01,704 --> 00:22:03,295
can send you steady work,

651
00:22:03,295 --> 00:22:05,141
and you can send work back to

652
00:22:05,141 --> 00:22:05,459
them.

653
00:22:05,809 --> 00:22:06,087
Seven.

654
00:22:06,267 --> 00:22:07,471
Ask for reviews,

655
00:22:07,471 --> 00:22:08,299
every time.

656
00:22:08,479 --> 00:22:10,174
Make it easy with a direct link.

657
00:22:10,354 --> 00:22:12,859
Reviews compound: each one makes the next

658
00:22:12,859 --> 00:22:14,998
customer more likely to choose you.

659
00:22:15,178 --> 00:22:15,759
And eight.

660
00:22:15,939 --> 00:22:17,162
Ask for referrals,

661
00:22:17,162 --> 00:22:18,249
and reward them.

662
00:22:18,429 --> 00:22:20,767
A small discount for both the customer

663
00:22:20,767 --> 00:22:22,859
and the friend they refer can turn

664
00:22:22,859 --> 00:22:25,198
every happy client into a salesperson.

665
00:22:25,548 --> 00:22:26,906
The pattern is simple.

666
00:22:27,086 --> 00:22:27,918
Do great work,

667
00:22:27,918 --> 00:22:28,868
make it visible,

668
00:22:28,868 --> 00:22:30,650
and ask for the next customer.

669
00:22:30,830 --> 00:22:32,052
It's not glamorous,

670
00:22:32,052 --> 00:22:34,752
but it's how most local service businesses

671
00:22:34,752 --> 00:22:37,002
grow, especially in the first year,

672
00:22:37,002 --> 00:22:39,188
before they ever spend a dollar on

673
00:22:39,188 --> 00:22:39,445
ads.

674
00:22:39,795 --> 00:22:41,848
Most of these businesses go through the

675
00:22:41,848 --> 00:22:42,744
same five stages.

676
00:22:42,924 --> 00:22:44,644
Knowing them helps you see where you

677
00:22:44,644 --> 00:22:45,791
are and what comes next.

678
00:22:46,142 --> 00:22:47,070
Stage one.

679
00:22:47,250 --> 00:22:47,935
The test.

680
00:22:48,115 --> 00:22:49,887
You're doing the work yourself,

681
00:22:49,887 --> 00:22:50,973
a few hours a week,

682
00:22:50,973 --> 00:22:53,259
and finding out whether people will pay.

683
00:22:53,439 --> 00:22:54,808
The goal is proof,

684
00:22:54,808 --> 00:22:55,644
not profit.

685
00:22:55,824 --> 00:22:57,044
Stage two.

686
00:22:57,224 --> 00:22:58,326
The side income.

687
00:22:58,506 --> 00:23:00,012
You have regular customers,

688
00:23:00,012 --> 00:23:01,963
and the business pays a few hundred

689
00:23:01,963 --> 00:23:03,859
to a few thousand dollars a month.

690
00:23:04,039 --> 00:23:05,810
You're still working your job,

691
00:23:05,810 --> 00:23:08,112
and the extra money goes toward savings

692
00:23:08,112 --> 00:23:08,938
and investing.

693
00:23:09,288 --> 00:23:10,472
Stage three.

694
00:23:10,652 --> 00:23:11,708
The decision.

695
00:23:11,888 --> 00:23:13,758
The business has grown to the point

696
00:23:13,758 --> 00:23:15,627
where it competes with your job for

697
00:23:15,627 --> 00:23:15,894
time.

698
00:23:16,074 --> 00:23:18,454
This is where many owners either stay

699
00:23:18,454 --> 00:23:19,805
part time on purpose,

700
00:23:19,805 --> 00:23:21,284
or plan a careful leap,

701
00:23:21,284 --> 00:23:23,921
with an emergency fund and several months

702
00:23:23,921 --> 00:23:25,594
of steady business income.

703
00:23:25,774 --> 00:23:26,749
Stage four.

704
00:23:26,929 --> 00:23:28,055
The first hire.

705
00:23:28,235 --> 00:23:29,725
You bring in a helper or an

706
00:23:29,725 --> 00:23:32,153
employee, and your role starts shifting from

707
00:23:32,153 --> 00:23:33,808
doing the work to managing it.

708
00:23:34,158 --> 00:23:35,307
And stage five.

709
00:23:35,487 --> 00:23:36,137
The asset.

710
00:23:36,317 --> 00:23:38,524
The business runs on systems and a

711
00:23:38,524 --> 00:23:41,704
team, with recurring customers and clean records.

712
00:23:41,884 --> 00:23:42,794
At this point,

713
00:23:42,794 --> 00:23:44,160
it's not just income.

714
00:23:44,340 --> 00:23:46,478
It's something with real value that could

715
00:23:46,478 --> 00:23:47,312
be sold one day.

716
00:23:47,492 --> 00:23:49,879
Not every business needs to reach stage

717
00:23:49,879 --> 00:23:50,185
five.

718
00:23:50,365 --> 00:23:52,636
But knowing it exists changes how you

719
00:23:52,636 --> 00:23:53,802
build from day one.

720
00:23:54,152 --> 00:23:55,057
Angle two.

721
00:23:55,237 --> 00:23:56,259
The psychology.

722
00:23:56,439 --> 00:23:58,580
The hardest part of starting a small

723
00:23:58,580 --> 00:24:00,305
business usually isn't money.

724
00:24:00,485 --> 00:24:01,507
It's in your head.

725
00:24:01,857 --> 00:24:04,347
The first obstacle is waiting until you

726
00:24:04,347 --> 00:24:05,049
feel ready.

727
00:24:05,229 --> 00:24:07,100
People spend months on logos,

728
00:24:07,100 --> 00:24:10,132
websites and business plans before they've ever

729
00:24:10,132 --> 00:24:11,487
talked to a customer.

730
00:24:11,667 --> 00:24:13,559
But you learn more from your first

731
00:24:13,559 --> 00:24:15,729
paying customer than from any amount of

732
00:24:15,729 --> 00:24:16,230
planning.

733
00:24:16,410 --> 00:24:18,736
Start with the smallest version of your

734
00:24:18,736 --> 00:24:20,764
service, and improve it as you go.

735
00:24:21,114 --> 00:24:23,227
The second is fear of asking.

736
00:24:23,407 --> 00:24:27,071
Asking friends, neighbors or local businesses for

737
00:24:27,071 --> 00:24:28,492
work feels awkward.

738
00:24:28,672 --> 00:24:30,611
But most people are glad to help

739
00:24:30,611 --> 00:24:31,702
someone they know,

740
00:24:31,702 --> 00:24:33,520
and word of mouth is still the

741
00:24:33,520 --> 00:24:36,125
most powerful marketing for local services.

742
00:24:36,305 --> 00:24:37,672
Try a simple message:

743
00:24:37,672 --> 00:24:40,276
I'm starting a pressure washing service.

744
00:24:40,456 --> 00:24:42,508
If you know anyone who needs it,

745
00:24:42,508 --> 00:24:44,624
I'd really appreciate a referral.

746
00:24:44,974 --> 00:24:46,564
The third is underpricing.

747
00:24:46,744 --> 00:24:49,248
New owners often charge too little because

748
00:24:49,248 --> 00:24:50,738
they feel like beginners.

749
00:24:50,918 --> 00:24:53,571
But low prices attract the most difficult

750
00:24:53,571 --> 00:24:56,029
customers and leave no room for taxes,

751
00:24:56,029 --> 00:24:57,582
insurance and equipment.

752
00:24:57,762 --> 00:24:59,598
Price for the value you deliver,

753
00:24:59,598 --> 00:25:01,779
and raise prices as your reviews grow.

754
00:25:02,129 --> 00:25:04,033
And the fourth is quitting too early.

755
00:25:04,213 --> 00:25:06,326
The first few months are often slow.

756
00:25:06,506 --> 00:25:08,611
Many people give up right before word

757
00:25:08,611 --> 00:25:09,977
of mouth starts to work.

758
00:25:10,157 --> 00:25:12,460
Give a new service business at least

759
00:25:12,460 --> 00:25:15,467
six months of consistent effort before deciding

760
00:25:15,467 --> 00:25:16,554
whether it works.

761
00:25:16,734 --> 00:25:19,070
Track what brings in customers,

762
00:25:19,070 --> 00:25:20,577
and do more of that.

763
00:25:20,927 --> 00:25:23,592
And the fifth obstacle is comparison with

764
00:25:23,592 --> 00:25:24,502
people online.

765
00:25:24,682 --> 00:25:27,130
Social media is full of young entrepreneurs

766
00:25:27,130 --> 00:25:29,521
claiming they made ten thousand dollars in

767
00:25:29,521 --> 00:25:30,546
their first month.

768
00:25:30,726 --> 00:25:31,921
Some are real.

769
00:25:32,101 --> 00:25:34,110
Many are selling courses.

770
00:25:34,290 --> 00:25:35,516
Comparing your quiet,

771
00:25:35,516 --> 00:25:38,203
steady progress to someone's highlight reel is

772
00:25:38,203 --> 00:25:39,663
a fast way to feel like a

773
00:25:39,663 --> 00:25:42,057
failure while you're actually doing fine.

774
00:25:42,237 --> 00:25:44,468
The only comparison that matters is your

775
00:25:44,468 --> 00:25:47,034
business this month versus your business three

776
00:25:47,034 --> 00:25:47,647
months ago.

777
00:25:47,827 --> 00:25:49,249
If that line is going up,

778
00:25:49,249 --> 00:25:50,103
you're winning.

779
00:25:50,453 --> 00:25:53,392
Underneath all of these obstacles is one

780
00:25:53,392 --> 00:25:56,037
simple truth: action beats thinking.

781
00:25:56,217 --> 00:25:59,115
The people who build successful small businesses

782
00:25:59,115 --> 00:26:01,409
aren't always the smartest or the most

783
00:26:01,409 --> 00:26:01,952
talented.

784
00:26:02,132 --> 00:26:04,488
They're the ones who started before they

785
00:26:04,488 --> 00:26:06,609
felt ready, asked for work even when

786
00:26:06,609 --> 00:26:07,492
it was awkward,

787
00:26:07,492 --> 00:26:08,670
charged fair prices,

788
00:26:08,670 --> 00:26:10,968
and kept going through the slow months.

789
00:26:11,318 --> 00:26:12,258
Angle three.

790
00:26:12,438 --> 00:26:13,251
The playbook.

791
00:26:13,431 --> 00:26:15,461
Here's a simple ninety day plan to

792
00:26:15,461 --> 00:26:17,432
go from idea to paying customers,

793
00:26:17,432 --> 00:26:18,806
while keeping your job.

794
00:26:19,156 --> 00:26:20,688
Days one to fifteen.

795
00:26:20,868 --> 00:26:22,927
Pick one business from this list that

796
00:26:22,927 --> 00:26:24,040
matches your skills,

797
00:26:24,040 --> 00:26:25,709
your schedule and your budget.

798
00:26:25,889 --> 00:26:29,158
Check licensing and insurance requirements in your

799
00:26:29,158 --> 00:26:30,139
city and state.

800
00:26:30,319 --> 00:26:32,037
Set up a separate bank account.

801
00:26:32,217 --> 00:26:34,104
And write down your price list,

802
00:26:34,104 --> 00:26:36,478
based on what local competitors charge.

803
00:26:36,828 --> 00:26:38,418
Days sixteen to thirty.

804
00:26:38,598 --> 00:26:40,479
Get your first three customers.

805
00:26:40,659 --> 00:26:43,294
Ask friends, family and neighbors.

806
00:26:43,474 --> 00:26:45,611
Post in local community groups.

807
00:26:45,791 --> 00:26:48,370
Offer a small launch discount in exchange

808
00:26:48,370 --> 00:26:49,692
for an honest review.

809
00:26:49,872 --> 00:26:51,269
Do outstanding work,

810
00:26:51,269 --> 00:26:53,296
take before and after photos,

811
00:26:53,296 --> 00:26:55,812
and ask each customer who else might

812
00:26:55,812 --> 00:26:57,070
need your service.

813
00:26:57,420 --> 00:26:58,999
Days thirty one to sixty.

814
00:26:59,179 --> 00:27:00,200
Build systems.

815
00:27:00,380 --> 00:27:02,003
A simple booking method,

816
00:27:02,003 --> 00:27:04,370
a template for quotes and invoices,

817
00:27:04,370 --> 00:27:06,128
a checklist for every job,

818
00:27:06,128 --> 00:27:08,089
and a way to collect reviews.

819
00:27:08,269 --> 00:27:10,371
Move a share of every payment into

820
00:27:10,371 --> 00:27:12,286
your tax account automatically.

821
00:27:12,466 --> 00:27:14,719
And track where each customer came from.

822
00:27:15,069 --> 00:27:17,019
Days sixty one to ninety.

823
00:27:17,199 --> 00:27:18,430
Grow what works.

824
00:27:18,610 --> 00:27:21,083
If referrals bring the most customers,

825
00:27:21,083 --> 00:27:22,580
ask for more referrals.

826
00:27:22,760 --> 00:27:24,991
If one neighborhood books the most,

827
00:27:24,991 --> 00:27:25,756
focus there.

828
00:27:25,936 --> 00:27:28,432
Raise prices slightly for new customers.

829
00:27:28,612 --> 00:27:30,657
And decide on your goal for the

830
00:27:30,657 --> 00:27:31,713
next six months:

831
00:27:31,713 --> 00:27:34,088
more income, more recurring clients,

832
00:27:34,088 --> 00:27:35,473
or your first helper.

833
00:27:35,824 --> 00:27:37,257
And one rule throughout:

834
00:27:37,257 --> 00:27:38,691
protect your foundation.

835
00:27:38,871 --> 00:27:40,418
Keep your emergency fund,

836
00:27:40,418 --> 00:27:42,397
keep contributing to retirement,

837
00:27:42,397 --> 00:27:44,253
and don't take on debt to grow

838
00:27:44,253 --> 00:27:46,789
a business that hasn't proven itself yet.

839
00:27:46,969 --> 00:27:49,037
The beauty of starting under five thousand

840
00:27:49,037 --> 00:27:50,662
dollars is that you never have to

841
00:27:50,662 --> 00:27:52,287
bet your family's security on it.

842
00:27:52,637 --> 00:27:55,678
Starting cheap protects you from big losses.

843
00:27:55,858 --> 00:27:57,837
But there are still mistakes that can

844
00:27:57,837 --> 00:27:59,655
sink a small business in its first

845
00:27:59,655 --> 00:27:59,922
year.

846
00:28:00,102 --> 00:28:02,169
Here are six of the most common.

847
00:28:02,519 --> 00:28:03,331
Mistake one.

848
00:28:03,511 --> 00:28:04,986
Skipping insurance.

849
00:28:05,166 --> 00:28:06,673
One damaged driveway,

850
00:28:06,673 --> 00:28:07,750
one dropped TV,

851
00:28:07,750 --> 00:28:08,898
one injured dog,

852
00:28:08,898 --> 00:28:11,266
and a single claim could wipe out

853
00:28:11,266 --> 00:28:13,061
a year of profit or more.

854
00:28:13,241 --> 00:28:16,714
General liability insurance is often affordable for

855
00:28:16,714 --> 00:28:18,416
small service businesses,

856
00:28:18,416 --> 00:28:20,323
and some clients require it.

857
00:28:20,503 --> 00:28:21,548
Mistake two.

858
00:28:21,728 --> 00:28:24,003
Mixing business and personal money.

859
00:28:24,183 --> 00:28:26,547
It makes taxes painful and hides whether

860
00:28:26,547 --> 00:28:28,142
you're actually profitable.

861
00:28:28,492 --> 00:28:29,479
Mistake three.

862
00:28:29,659 --> 00:28:31,899
Buying too much equipment too early.

863
00:28:32,079 --> 00:28:33,823
The top of the line mower,

864
00:28:33,823 --> 00:28:35,768
the van with custom graphics,

865
00:28:35,768 --> 00:28:37,176
the expensive camera.

866
00:28:37,356 --> 00:28:39,086
Start with what you need to do

867
00:28:39,086 --> 00:28:41,508
good work, and upgrade only when customers

868
00:28:41,508 --> 00:28:42,546
are paying for it.

869
00:28:42,726 --> 00:28:43,724
Mistake four.

870
00:28:43,904 --> 00:28:45,530
Saying yes to every job.

871
00:28:45,710 --> 00:28:46,733
Jobs far away,

872
00:28:46,733 --> 00:28:48,560
jobs outside your skills,

873
00:28:48,560 --> 00:28:51,922
or jobs from customers who haggle aggressively

874
00:28:51,922 --> 00:28:54,115
often cost more than they pay.

875
00:28:54,465 --> 00:28:55,498
Mistake five.

876
00:28:55,678 --> 00:28:58,232
Forgetting about taxes until April.

877
00:28:58,412 --> 00:28:59,709
We talked about this,

878
00:28:59,709 --> 00:29:01,129
but it bears repeating.

879
00:29:01,309 --> 00:29:03,960
Set aside a share of every payment,

880
00:29:03,960 --> 00:29:07,445
and consider paying estimated taxes during the

881
00:29:07,445 --> 00:29:10,399
year, as the IRS generally expects from

882
00:29:10,399 --> 00:29:11,990
self employed people.

883
00:29:12,170 --> 00:29:13,528
And mistake six.

884
00:29:13,708 --> 00:29:14,962
Not tracking anything.

885
00:29:15,142 --> 00:29:16,960
Without knowing your revenue,

886
00:29:16,960 --> 00:29:19,217
costs and where customers come from,

887
00:29:19,217 --> 00:29:21,098
you can't tell what's working.

888
00:29:21,448 --> 00:29:23,706
Every one of these mistakes is cheap

889
00:29:23,706 --> 00:29:25,650
to avoid and expensive to make.

890
00:29:25,830 --> 00:29:27,803
Insurance, a separate account,

891
00:29:27,803 --> 00:29:30,828
modest equipment, clear rules about which jobs

892
00:29:30,828 --> 00:29:32,406
you take, a tax account,

893
00:29:32,406 --> 00:29:34,050
and a simple spreadsheet.

894
00:29:34,230 --> 00:29:36,337
That's the whole defensive playbook,

895
00:29:36,337 --> 00:29:38,210
and it costs less than a weekend

896
00:29:38,210 --> 00:29:38,503
away.

897
00:29:38,853 --> 00:29:41,321
You don't need expensive software to run

898
00:29:41,321 --> 00:29:42,370
a small business.

899
00:29:42,550 --> 00:29:45,348
Here's a lean toolkit many owners use.

900
00:29:45,699 --> 00:29:48,546
For money: a separate business checking account,

901
00:29:48,546 --> 00:29:50,741
a separate savings account for taxes,

902
00:29:50,741 --> 00:29:52,461
and a simple way to take card

903
00:29:52,461 --> 00:29:53,826
payments on your phone.

904
00:29:54,006 --> 00:29:56,643
For bookkeeping, a spreadsheet works at the

905
00:29:56,643 --> 00:29:59,402
start, and low cost accounting software makes

906
00:29:59,402 --> 00:30:01,610
sense once you have regular clients.

907
00:30:01,790 --> 00:30:04,470
For scheduling, a shared calendar or a

908
00:30:04,470 --> 00:30:06,515
basic booking tool is plenty.

909
00:30:06,866 --> 00:30:09,835
For marketing: a free business profile on

910
00:30:09,835 --> 00:30:11,574
map and search services,

911
00:30:11,574 --> 00:30:13,457
a simple one page website,

912
00:30:13,457 --> 00:30:15,630
and a phone full of before and

913
00:30:15,630 --> 00:30:16,572
after photos.

914
00:30:16,752 --> 00:30:18,479
For customer communication,

915
00:30:18,479 --> 00:30:19,822
templates for quotes,

916
00:30:19,822 --> 00:30:22,573
reminders and thank you messages save hours

917
00:30:22,573 --> 00:30:23,276
every week.

918
00:30:23,456 --> 00:30:24,513
And for learning,

919
00:30:24,513 --> 00:30:27,433
free online courses and videos from experienced

920
00:30:27,433 --> 00:30:28,925
owners in your industry.

921
00:30:29,275 --> 00:30:31,695
The point is to keep fixed costs

922
00:30:31,695 --> 00:30:34,418
close to zero until revenue is real.

923
00:30:34,598 --> 00:30:37,331
Every subscription and every monthly fee raises

924
00:30:37,331 --> 00:30:39,308
the amount you need to earn before

925
00:30:39,308 --> 00:30:41,343
you make a single dollar of profit.

926
00:30:41,523 --> 00:30:44,182
Lean businesses survive slow months.

927
00:30:44,362 --> 00:30:45,674
Bloated ones don't.

928
00:30:46,024 --> 00:30:48,264
Let me answer the questions people ask

929
00:30:48,264 --> 00:30:49,797
most about starting small.

930
00:30:50,147 --> 00:30:50,959
Question one.

931
00:30:51,139 --> 00:30:52,277
Do I need an LLC?

932
00:30:52,457 --> 00:30:53,852
Not always to start,

933
00:30:53,852 --> 00:30:56,504
but many owners form one for liability

934
00:30:56,504 --> 00:30:59,713
protection and simpler separation of finances.

935
00:30:59,893 --> 00:31:02,134
Rules and fees vary by state.

936
00:31:02,314 --> 00:31:05,008
Insurance is often just as important as

937
00:31:05,008 --> 00:31:06,389
the legal structure.

938
00:31:06,569 --> 00:31:07,498
Question two.

939
00:31:07,678 --> 00:31:09,861
How do I find my first customers?

940
00:31:10,041 --> 00:31:11,170
People you know,

941
00:31:11,170 --> 00:31:12,581
local online groups,

942
00:31:12,581 --> 00:31:15,898
neighborhood apps, and simple flyers still work

943
00:31:15,898 --> 00:31:17,239
for local services.

944
00:31:17,589 --> 00:31:18,552
Question three.

945
00:31:18,732 --> 00:31:20,872
What if my employer has a policy

946
00:31:20,872 --> 00:31:22,343
