947
00:31:22,523 --> 00:31:24,811
Read your employment agreement,

948
00:31:24,811 --> 00:31:27,838
especially if your business is related to

949
00:31:27,838 --> 00:31:28,502
your job.

950
00:31:28,682 --> 00:31:31,600
Keep your business completely separate from work

951
00:31:31,600 --> 00:31:33,059
time and work equipment.

952
00:31:33,239 --> 00:31:34,261
Question four.

953
00:31:34,441 --> 00:31:35,764
When should I quit my job?

954
00:31:35,944 --> 00:31:38,348
Many people wait until the business has

955
00:31:38,348 --> 00:31:40,691
