956
00:31:40,691 --> 00:31:42,417
for several months in a row,

957
00:31:42,417 --> 00:31:44,698
and they have a solid emergency fund.

958
00:31:45,048 --> 00:31:46,000
Question five.

959
00:31:46,180 --> 00:31:47,596
Which one makes the most money?

960
00:31:47,776 --> 00:31:50,157
The ones that can grow beyond your

961
00:31:50,157 --> 00:31:52,748
own hours, through recurring clients,

962
00:31:52,748 --> 00:31:54,990
