964
00:31:57,301 --> 00:31:58,701
cleaning, lawn care,

965
00:31:58,701 --> 00:32:00,802
pressure washing, bookkeeping.

966
00:32:00,982 --> 00:32:03,520
Services where you sell only your time,

967
00:32:03,520 --> 00:32:05,863
like tutoring or virtual assistance,

968
00:32:05,863 --> 00:32:08,011
are easier to start but harder to

969
00:32:08,011 --> 00:32:08,401
scale.

970
00:32:08,752 --> 00:32:09,843
Question six.

971
00:32:10,023 --> 00:32:12,078
Can I do this with no experience?

972
00:32:12,258 --> 00:32:13,403
For many of these,

973
00:32:13,403 --> 00:32:15,311
yes, with some learning first.

974
00:32:15,491 --> 00:32:16,907
Cleaning, lawn care,

975
00:32:16,907 --> 00:32:19,738
pet sitting and reselling have low skill

976
00:32:19,738 --> 00:32:23,560
