977
00:32:23,740 --> 00:32:25,518
Others, like bookkeeping,

978
00:32:25,518 --> 00:32:27,723
tutoring and personal training,

979
00:32:27,723 --> 00:32:30,497
need real knowledge or a certification.

980
00:32:30,677 --> 00:32:33,508
Be honest with customers about your experience,

981
00:32:33,508 --> 00:32:35,797
and price accordingly while you learn.

982
00:32:36,148 --> 00:32:37,158
Question seven.

983
00:32:37,338 --> 00:32:39,346
How much can I realistically earn?

984
00:32:39,526 --> 00:32:41,592
It varies enormously by city,

985
00:32:41,592 --> 00:32:42,945
