988
00:32:47,113 --> 00:32:49,469
A realistic first goal for most people

989
00:32:49,469 --> 00:32:51,452
is a few hundred dollars a month

990
00:32:51,452 --> 00:32:52,939
in the first few months,

991
00:32:52,939 --> 00:32:55,356
growing as reviews and referrals build.

992
00:32:55,536 --> 00:32:57,893
The businesses that grow biggest are the

993
00:32:57,893 --> 00:33:00,072
ones whose owners keep showing up for

994
00:33:00,072 --> 00:33:01,132
