so start small to make failure survivable,

1014
00:33:46,835 --> 00:33:48,925
and set aside money for taxes.

1015
00:33:49,105 --> 00:33:51,911
The psychology: you'll never feel ready,

1016
00:33:51,911 --> 00:33:52,823
ask for work,

1017
00:33:52,823 --> 00:33:55,699
don't underprice, and give it six months.

1018
00:33:55,879 --> 00:33:56,971
And the playbook:

1019
00:33:56,971 --> 00:33:59,669
ninety days from idea to paying customers,

1020
00:33:59,669 --> 00:34:01,788
while protecting your foundation.

1021
00:34:02,139 --> 00:34:03,567
And here's the bigger picture.

1022
00:34:03,747 --> 00:34:06,022
A small business you start for under

1023
